e":"赠庞玠术者","author":"李石","text":"难易如何是祖风，却将性命问庞公。\n向来一口西江水，因甚谈天不落空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59195,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠钓车道人","author":"李石","text":"铁弹牵丝响钓轮，鱼竿妙与易通神。\n莫将瓦卜欺天眼，误看凡夫作道人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59196,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瞿唐峡","author":"李石","text":"花开归去客在船，人道云安有杜鹃。\n峡山无路续百丈，胡猕上树拊联天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59197,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一笑","author":"李石","text":"一笑真成亟负余，可人懒散费招呼。\n忘言摩诘元无病，健倒卢仝不用扶。\n野葛三餐莫予毒，桃花几度约吾徒。\n杜门人与春偷老，风雨声中长白须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59198,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]